**Results and Impact**

**Before Aggregation**:
- **Incident Detection Time**: 23 minutes to identify root cause across 47 services
- **Manual Correlation**: Operations manually checked each service health endpoint
- **Cascading Failure Visibility**: No visibility into dependency chain during incidents
- **Monitoring Complexity**: 78 individual service health endpoints configured in monitoring
- **False Positives**: Services reported "healthy" while dependencies failing (Pricing Service reported healthy with database down)

**After Aggregation**:
- **Incident Detection Time**: 30 seconds to identify root cause via aggregated health endpoint
  - Gateway health showed "unhealthy"
  - Dependency tree revealed Pricing Service → SQL Database as root cause
  - Reduced detection time by 98% (23 minutes → 30 seconds)

- **Root Cause Identification**: Immediate visibility into failing dependency
  - Claims API Gateway `/health/aggregated` showed Pricing Service unhealthy
  - Pricing Service `/health/aggregated` showed SQL Database critical dependency failed
  - Connection pool exhaustion details visible in health response

- **Monitoring Simplification**: Reduced configuration from 78 endpoints to 3 aggregated endpoints
  - Tier 1: Claims API Gateway (aggregates 8 backend services)
  - Tier 2: Pricing Service (aggregates database + APIs)
  - Tier 3: Payment Service (aggregates database + external payment gateway)
  - Setup time reduced from 12 hours to 2 hours
  - Monthly maintenance reduced from 3 hours to 20 minutes

- **Improved Availability**: Claims Platform availability improved from 99.2% to 99.8%
  - Exceeded 99.5% SLA target
  - Reduced unplanned downtime from 70 hours/year to 17 hours/year (75% reduction)

- **Enhanced Operations**: Operations team effectiveness improved significantly
  - Single dashboard view for entire Claims Platform health
  - No manual correlation required during incidents
  - New team member onboarding reduced from 4 weeks to 2 weeks
  - On-call pages reduced from 47/month to 12/month (74% reduction)

