- **Improved User Experience**: Clear messaging explaining unavailable features with alternatives
  - User satisfaction improved from 2.1/5 to 4.3/5 during degraded operation
- **Reduced Support Volume**: Support tickets reduced from 342 to 23 (93% reduction)
  - Remaining tickets were proactive follow-ups, not confused users
- **Automated Degradation**: No manual intervention required
  - Gateway automatically detected failing service and activated fallback
  - Load balancer continued routing to gateway (status: degraded, HTTP 200)
